  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multimodal models (e.g., config_039) outperform RNA-only models, but the exact contribution of image encoders and fusion strategies remains unclear. This experiment tests a multimodal model with scvi_n200 RNA encoder, resnet50 image encoder, and weighted fusion (same as config_039 but with aggregation=None). It isolates the impact of the image encoder (resnet50 vs. imagenet_vit_l) and aggregation method, which are critical design choices with uncertain effects. This comparison is informative without changing multiple variables simultaneously, aligning with the principle of balancing exploration and exploitation."
